IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpa-dates`
IMPORT `cpa-rules`
IMPORT `cpa-seat`

-- Civil Procedure Act 2010 (Vic) -- worked cases for the party's questions (cpa-seat.l4) and the date helpers
-- (cpa-dates.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text; none was copied from the encoding's
-- output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. The facts are illustrative.
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`

§§ `Dates`

-- 24 months back from 15 March 2027 is 15 March 2025; from 29 February 2028 it is 28 February 2026 (no 29th: last day,
-- fork F6); one month back from 31 March 2027 is 28 February 2027; one month back from 15 January 2027 crosses the year.
#ASSERT `the date` 24 `months before` (`d` 15 3 2027) EQUALS `d` 15 3 2025
#ASSERT `the date` 24 `months before` (`d` 29 2 2028) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `the date` 1 `months before` (`d` 31 3 2027) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2027
#ASSERT `the date` 1 `months before` (`d` 15 1 2027) EQUALS `d` 15 12 2026
#ASSERT `the date` 12 `months before` (`d` 29 2 2028) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2027
#ASSERT `the days from` (`d` 1 2 2027) `to` (`d` 15 2 2027) EQUALS 14

