#ASSERT `Does the Civil Procedure Act apply to my case` `the Supreme Court` FALSE `the Proceeds of Crime Act 1987 or 2002 of the Commonwealth` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the Civil Procedure Act apply to my case` `the County Court` FALSE `the Victims of Crime Assistance Act 1996` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the Civil Procedure Act apply to my case` `the Magistrates' Court` FALSE `the Youth Justice Act 2024` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the Civil Procedure Act apply to my case` `the County Court` FALSE `none of the Acts section 4(2) lists` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

