-- Arguments: aware, court directed, day directed, earliest reasonable day, disclosed, day disclosed, today.
#ASSERT `Is my disclosure in time` (`d` 1 2 2027) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 15 2 2027) TRUE (`d` 15 2 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `done in time`
#ASSERT `Is my disclosure in time` (`d` 1 2 2027) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 15 2 2027) TRUE (`d` 1 2 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `done in time`
#ASSERT `Is my disclosure in time` (`d` 1 2 2027) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 15 2 2027) TRUE (`d` 16 2 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `not done in time`
