§§ `s 42 -- proper basis certification`

-- Arguments: the filing, rules or court require, exempt as administrative, lawyer.
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `my first substantive document` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `my legal practitioner must file it`
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `my first substantive document` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `I must complete and file it personally`
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `a later substantive document that makes, adds or substitutes a claim or cause of action` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `my legal practitioner must file it`
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `a later substantive document that makes a significant amendment to an earlier one` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `I must complete and file it personally`
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `a later substantive document that does none of these` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `a later substantive document that does none of these` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `my legal practitioner must file it`
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `a document that is not a substantive document` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Who files the proper basis certification` `my first substantive document` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `no one: the rules exempt the document as administrative`

