§§ `s 51 -- case management sanctions`

-- Arguments: breached, side, sanction.
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` FALSE `a plaintiff` `dismiss the proceeding, or a cause of action or claim in it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a plaintiff` `dismiss the proceeding, or a cause of action or claim in it` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a plaintiff` `strike out or limit my claim` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a defendant` `strike out or limit my claim` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a defendant` `strike out or limit my defence and give judgment accordingly` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a plaintiff` `strike out or limit my defence and give judgment accordingly` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a defendant` `direct me to pay costs of another party or person` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` TRUE `a plaintiff` `disallow or reject evidence I adduced or seek to adduce` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court impose this case management sanction on me` FALSE `a defendant` `direct me to pay costs of another party or person` EQUALS JUST FALSE

